  },
  {
    n: "3",
    title: "Do it early and keep the paper trail",
    body: "Clinical psychologists writing in the Indian Journal of Psychiatry (2024) say the assessment tools are not equipped to assess adults, which the Gazette itself notes. They also say students in Class 12 or later without earlier certificates often lack school records. Keep report cards, teacher notes and remedial-class records from the school years.",
  },
  {
    n: "4",
    title: "Then apply for the UDID",
