const chipLabel = { high: "Scalable", mid: "Scalable with a business layer", low: "Not so scalable" };
---

<BlogPostLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  seoTitle={seoTitle}
  seoDescription={seoDescription}
  canonical={canonical}
  category="career-options"
  publishedAt={publishedDateISO}
  publishedLabel={publishedDateLabel}
  authorName={authorName}
  authorUrl={authorUrl}
  authorRole={authorRole}
  jsonLdExtras={[faqJsonLd]}
>
  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Career options for students with dyslexia and learning disabilities in India are
    wider than most lists admit, and the first step is paperwork, not a job title.</strong> A
    learning disability is one of the 21 disabilities in the RPwD Act 2016. A positive NIMHANS test
    counts as a benchmark disability of more than 40 percent, which unlocks exam help, seat
    reservation and scholarships. After that, the decisions that unlock high income opportunities
    are about tasks: lean on your strengths, put tools on the weak spots, and build a high-income
    skill portfolio others can see.
  </p>

  <div class="key-takeaways">
    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Get assessed early.</strong> The assessment tools are built for children, so adults and Class 12 students should start now and keep school records. Exam help differs by body: JEE Main gave extra time, CLAT 40 minutes, and ICSI lists spelling leniency.</li>
      <li><strong>Choose by task, not by label.</strong> Software, data and sales scale best. Design, own business, teaching and hospitality work with strong proof. Government jobs and law are real but rank-gated, so keep a second plan.</li>
      <li><strong>Next step:</strong> test two routes with The 4-Checkpoint Protocol further down and finish one real piece of work. That piece is the first item in a high-income skill portfolio, and the quickest way to earlier financial freedom.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p>
    This guide sits inside our wider set of
    <a href="/blog/career-options/">career options for every stream and degree</a>. For the full
    legal picture, including the 5 percent college floor and scholarships for every disability,
    read <a href="/blog/career-options/career-options-for-students-with-disabilities-india/">career options for students with disabilities</a>.
    If you are choosing a stream, start with
    <a href="/blog/career-options/career-options-after-12th/">career options after 12th</a>.
  </p>

  <nav class="jump-nav" aria-label="Article sections">
    <p class="jump-nav__label">Jump to section</p>
    <ul class="jump-nav__list">
      {jumpLinks.map((item) => (
        <li><a href={`#${item.id}`}>{item.label}</a></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <h2 id="what-counts">What counts as a learning disability</h2>

  <p>
    The Act uses the term specific learning disability. A commonly quoted definition calls it a group of
    conditions with a deficit in processing language, spoken or written, that can show as difficulty
    in reading, writing, spelling or maths, and includes dyslexia, dysgraphia, dyscalculia,
    dyspraxia and developmental aphasia.
  </p>

  <p>
    Intelligence is not the issue. Three differences are named
    most often.
  </p>

  <div class="strand-grid">
    {strands.map((s) => (
      <div class="strand-card">
        <div class="strand-card__name">{s.name}</div>
        <p>{s.body}</p>
        <p class="strand-card__watch"><span>Watch out</span>{s.watch}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    Many people have more than one difference, and each person's mix is different. A report from a
    qualified psychologist or doctor, not a website quiz, tells you which applies to you.
  </p>

  <h2 id="certificate">The certificate: how SLD is assessed and what it unlocks</h2>

  <p>
    Without a certificate, accommodation depends on goodwill. With one, it is a right to ask. The
    process has four steps.
  </p>

  <div class="ladder">
    {certSteps.map((s) => (
      <div class="ladder-step">
        <div class="ladder-step__num">{s.n}</div>
        <div>
          <div class="ladder-step__title">{s.title}</div>
          <p>{s.body}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Checked on 30 October 2026 against the Ministry of Social Justice and Empowerment's amended
    SLD guidelines (S.O. 4501(E), 9 December 2020, read from a state government copy) and the exam
    documents named below. Rules move yearly, so confirm on the official page.
  </p>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      Practice is uneven. A 2024 paper on the topic says there are no uniform provisions across the
      country, and that concessions differ by state and board.
  </p>

  <p>
    So a certificate is necessary but not a
      guarantee. Ask the exam body what it accepts before you pay for a private assessment, and
      keep the school records that show your difficulty over time.
    </p>
  </div>

