  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      <strong>The ownership path:</strong> turn your best skill into a small firm. A solo design
      studio, a repair or events service, or an outsourced sales team for local shops all let you
      choose clients, hand the paperwork to a partner or accountant, and quote per job.
  </p>

  <p>
    Regulars
      fill your calendar, and you hire help for routine tasks later. Agree scope, price and number of
